# November 18, 2026: Delaware County, New York (the western Catskills): Andes, Middletown (Margaretville, Halcottsville,
# Fleischmanns), Roxbury, Delhi, Hamden, Colchester (Downsville), Tompkins and Meredith. Drawn at random by
# tools/choose.py (region cat), which offered Andes, Roxbury and Delhi; the Atlas had only the Pepacton villages within
# 10 km of any of them. Mostly standing buildings, with a fire tower above the drowned Rock Rift hamlet. Sources opened in
# this session: Wikipedia as raw text (tools/wiki_raw.py, including the Delaware County Register list), and through
# tools/page.py the pages of the Hanford Mills Museum, NY State Parks, the Woodchuck Lodge trust, the Andes Society for
# History and Culture, the Town of Roxbury's history page, the Historical Society of Middletown, the Tiffany census at
# cambridge2000.com, Congregation Bnai Israel, the Catskill Mountain Club, CNY Hiking, the Finger Lakes Trail
# Conference hike sheet and the Watershed Post.
